                "description": "The Hercules Lever is simple but, when paired with a contemporary style rose, it is transformed into a beautiful and modern design. It is available dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Hercules Lever with Square Rose will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n",
